    "s01": { "translation": "O Lord, by the working of this mystery may our vices be cleansed and our just desires fulfilled. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
